## Mobile-First Responsive Design and PWA Enhancement

This PR implements comprehensive mobile-first responsive design and PWA enhancements for ChastityOS, transforming the app into a fully mobile-optimized progressive web application.

## ✅ Completed Features

### Mobile-First Foundation
- **Enhanced PWA Manifest**: Added mobile shortcuts, proper icons, orientation settings, and app-like behavior with background sync support
- **Touch-Friendly CSS**: Implemented 44px minimum touch targets, mobile-safe animations, and fluid typography system
- **Safe Area Support**: Added CSS environment variables for notched devices (iPhone X+, dynamic island)
- **Mobile Viewport**: Optimized HTML meta tags with proper scaling, security headers, and iOS-specific enhancements

### Touch & Gesture System
- **Touch Gestures Hook**: Complete swipe, tap, long-press detection with customizable thresholds and directions
- **Haptic Feedback Integration**: Native device vibration patterns (light, medium, heavy, success, error)
- **Pull-to-Refresh**: Native-like refresh functionality with visual feedback and haptic responses
- **Swipeable Cards**: Cards with left/right swipe actions, smooth animations, and configurable action buttons

### Complete Mobile Component Library
- **MobileButton**: Touch-optimized buttons with haptic feedback, loading states, and multiple variants
- **MobileInput**: Form inputs with iOS zoom prevention, mobile keyboard optimization, and validation
- **MobileCard**: Elevated, outlined, and glass morphism card variants with touch interactions
- **TouchTarget**: Ensures WCAG accessibility compliance with proper 44px minimum touch areas
- **BottomSheet**: Native-like modals that slide from bottom with gesture support and safe area handling
- **BottomNavigation**: Fixed tab bar with smooth transitions, haptic feedback, and badge support
- **VirtualList**: Performance-optimized list component for handling thousands of items efficiently
- **SwipeableCard**: Cards with configurable swipe actions and visual feedback

### Enhanced Navigation & UX
- **Mobile Bottom Navigation**: Integrated fixed tab bar in AppLayout with proper safe area handling
- **Touch-Friendly Menu**: Improved hamburger menu with proper touch targets and animations
- **Viewport Detection**: Comprehensive device type, orientation, and safe area detection
- **Performance Optimizations**: Hardware acceleration, reduced motion support, and high contrast mode

### Advanced PWA Features
- **App Shortcuts**: Quick actions for logging events, viewing tracker, and accessing keyholder features
- **Background Sync**: Offline action queuing with automatic sync when connection restored
- **Enhanced Caching**: Optimized resource caching strategies for mobile performance
- **Apple Touch Icons**: Complete icon set for iOS home screen installation
- **Splash Screens**: Native-like startup experience on iOS devices

### Developer Experience
- **Mobile Hooks Library**: Custom hooks for viewport, gestures, haptics, and pull-to-refresh
- **Mobile Showcase Page**: Comprehensive demo page showcasing all mobile components and interactions
- **TypeScript Support**: Full type safety across all mobile components and hooks
- **Accessibility First**: ARIA labels, keyboard navigation, screen reader support, and reduced motion compliance

## Technical Implementation

The mobile-first approach includes:
- **CSS Custom Properties** for consistent theming across mobile/desktop breakpoints
- **Container Queries** for component-based responsive design patterns
- **Touch Event Handling** with proper gesture recognition and prevention of default behaviors
- **PWA Enhancements** with background sync, offline capabilities, and native app-like features
- **Performance Optimizations** specifically tuned for low-end mobile devices

All components follow WCAG accessibility guidelines with proper ARIA labels, keyboard navigation support, and screen reader compatibility. The implementation uses modern web standards and provides a native app-like experience while maintaining excellent performance across all mobile devices.

Fixes thef4tdaddy/chastityOS#98

